---
// NetworkMesh.astro - Ambient Interactive Network Topology Background
---

<canvas id="network-mesh-canvas" class="network-mesh-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

<style>
  .network-mesh-canvas {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
    opacity: 0.65;
    transition: opacity 300ms ease;
  }

  :global(.dark) .network-mesh-canvas {
    opacity: 0.82;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .network-mesh-canvas {
      opacity: 0.4;
    }
  }
</style>
